# Agent Communication Interfaces

Every agent output must be structured enough for the next agent to validate.

The chat that wrote the plan launches each implementation step and validates it before handoff. A subagent summary is not acceptance. See `15-agent-complete-plan.mdc`.

## Required Handoff Format

Use this format between agents:

```md
## Understanding
<short restatement>

## Inputs Validated
<what was checked>

## Output
<deliverable>

## Risks / Unknowns
<items that need attention>

## Next Agent Checklist
<what the next agent must verify>
```
